 "title": "ERFVII Regulates Genes in Response to Hypoxia and Precipitation Regimes",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around ERFVII, a gene or protein that regulates several other genes and processes. It is expressed in Arabidopsis and contains MynOx and MATα W303 cells. ERFVII has a conditional proteostasis relationship with Cys-NDP and regulates HRG, PCO, and PCO4. PCO4 has a c-terminal fusion with 6TAL-VP64, GAL4, and Ubiquitin. UbSYRAP binds to HRPEADH-NLUC and degrades PCO4 module. The cluster also includes relationships between genes and processes related to plant adaptation, root architecture, and protein accumulation.",
